## 6. Monitoring Thresholds

Monitoring requires defined thresholds rather than subjective judgments.

Example:

| Metric                      |       Target | Alert Condition     | PM Action                                     |
| --------------------------- | -----------: | ------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| Retrieval Accuracy          |         ≥90% | Below 90%           | Investigate retrieval/data issue.             |
| Answer Accuracy             |         ≥90% | Below 90%           | Investigate AI quality.                       |
| Hallucination               |          <2% | ≥2%                 | Investigate immediately.                      |
| Citation Correctness        |         100% | Any failure         | Investigate and assess release/rollback risk. |
| Unsupported Refusal         |         100% | Any unsafe response | Investigate immediately.                      |
| Response Time               | ≥95% ≤10 sec | Below target        | Investigate performance.                      |
| User Satisfaction           |         ≥85% | Below target        | Analyze feedback and usability.               |
| Critical Security Incidents |            0 | Any incident        | Activate security response.                   |

